# Vercel
.vercel

# Pre-optimisation image masters. scripts/optimize-images.js moves the
# originals here after re-encoding them into public/assets as WebP, so they
# stay on disk to re-run from without being deployed or committed.
.image-originals/

# Second build output, used when a production build has to run while the dev
# server is up (NEXT_DIST_DIR=.next-build). See next.config.mjs.
.next-build/
